abstract: "Code and records of Salmon Ladder, a training-free detector of recurring out-of-distribution images: label propagation from a few labelled images over one graph of all test images, self-labelled seeds selected by the Benjamini-Hochberg procedure on conformal ranks, and propagation from the seeds; with the records of the earlier online variant."
